    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA gaygoorgweaksa giliwas sih aba giteena sinaweagaaschi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Heapi! Gideabeadaanyi naaha gil oorukuni ghwasiildeang'su aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli nea gooyeenyi, ‘Ghweaniga niyaak sabiibooda mii ghwaheas. Nea diibiga geanung' ghwadaang'suus geeshatka.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideabideati, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ghwasiildeang'su maygudeergu aba ng'eanyiida Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, gurooruunatka sean geasu gil. Guroorooda ghweanda ea dea orjeeda deanyu gil, nea dea sina riing'eeda gayghami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak siida iidoabiiwaat ak gwasin gea hidaat ea gea doobiiweadi– ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iimabareanyi sea lukghumajeega sanaamajeega bea uhuuda giijeeda. Nea makghusa sanaamajeega fuga Israeli, ak ea mii gawa heeda gatmooda giischeewoocheandaanyi nea mii gwaluudayi gatmooda neaweesa eaghwada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mii ghaghabwas siida, ak ea niidealda siileeda siida, nea mii ghoareat siida haleanjeadaanyi aba uurda. Ak ea niidaw fuga bearji jalooda hamitaanyi, nea ghoadaw hang'weaka fuga dawiiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mii ghwanung' ghoalaach siida lapiya aba gideaba ghwanyagaada. Ak ea mii ghoang'waay haleanjeeda sean naawda, nea ghwasaja geatindaanyi gidamuy nea gwasin girgweageeda doabiiwaat aba heeda buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwaat geeshta deaweedajeegeasu nea ghoang'waay hamurajeegeasu. Siisi abeeda ea doabiiwaat aba huumwa gayghwanyas eaweega, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siida ii mideawa orjeeda was mareanghweanda ghana dea nuusa buuneeda ghana gwasina dea was sean aba jeedeaba suh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak jeebi gwasin gida mii gwasin ghwaan, ghwaak lukghumeeda ghayi siheawa aba hoowa bea uhuuda giijeedean, ak gawa heeda gatmooda giischeewoocheandaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghoareat fuga barbari haleanjeeda nyaawa ea fuga gasa weeta, nea ghoareat buuneeda haleanjeeda nyaawa aba uurda, nea mawalda siileeda siida, ak ghabwat sanaamajeega nea gwasin ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeesa ghwanung' ghoalaach buuneeda lapiyeadaanyi aba gideaba ghwanyas gea aptu. Ak ghwanyas gea naawda, heapi! Iing'ata suh gayghwanyas eaweega? Manda, mayghwanyas eaweega, aba gideaba nisin ng'asheesu munyas seaniin aba huumwa gayghami foojeandaanyi gaygwanda badaydaanyi nea gabwageaw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siisi ii mideawa orjeeda nidaah riing'eega sean sin ghwaan, ak ghabeal, ak ea masina ng'asheega uurji suh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mii ghwaak lukghumeeda ghayi siheawa aba uhuuda giijeega nea mabwada sanaamajeega fuga Israeli nea mii gawa heeda gatmooda giischeewoocheandaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mii ghoareat siida gidaanyi, nea mandeawana siileeda siida. Ak ea mii ghoareat siida haleanjeadaanyi aba uurda, ak ea niidaw fuga bearji jalooda hamita nea gookwealsheesa fuga dawiiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gicha ea nisaja geatindaanyi ghabasta fuga barbari, ak ea mii ghoang'waay gidalagaan ea ghwanaawda, nea ghwaat geeshta deaweedajeegeasu, ea huumeanyeekeasu ak nih ea mayghami aba ng'asheega munyas bea ghwaan aba huumwa gayghwanyas eaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba badayda ng'asheega ghwaan, aba gideaba ghayi ghaghabwas buuneeda aba ng'weaninda muuchi, nea ghoareat orjeeda ghaamwat haleanjeadaanyi aba uurda nea gwasin gea mii miyaasiin aba bugusta fugaaschi. Ng'ula, gayghami aba ng'asheagaaschi munyas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea agooga gooyeenyi, ‘Ghwasaan anda orjeeda gayghwasar munyinda ghwaan?’ Nea orjeedida iisin gea hit nea doabiiwaat nea ghoang'waay deaweedajeegeasu sean ak gwasin, abeeda gayghwanyas eaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guroorooda sin riing'eega gayghami. Orjeeda mayghwanyas sawanadeeda aba munyinda ghwaan, ghana ghwaan mayghwanyas sawanadeeda aba munyinda orjeedaanyi doobiiwnataanyi nea gabwageaw doobiiwnata gaygwanda badaydaanyi, nea munyindaanyi gaygwanda badaydaanyi nea gabwageaw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siida muy seara iinung'waada riing'eagaaschi sean ghayi sin, ak ghoang'waay deaweedajeegeasu sean, ak ghoang'waay gea hidaat ea gea doobiiweadi aba huumwa gayghwanyas eaweega mayghami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riing'eagaaschi sean ghayi sin majeapkaat eara akaleala, aba doobiiwnataanyi ghayi sin gayghwanyas eaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi! Aniini geahoosanyi aba miyeeda siida muy? Gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, mang'wana ghwanung'waada naweadingaaschi munyas ak ghwanyas eaweega? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak siida doabiiwaat inyas ghwanung'waada doobiiwnataanyi ak gwasin ng'asheega munyas nea gwasin ng'asheegiga bea sicheeda sin siida muyiin heapi nih gayghwanyas eaweega? Manda sinaweega sin sean niyaas sin maygudu eapkaat, gayghami aba heeheeweega ea riing'eeda ghayi sin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea agooga gooyeenyi, ‘Ng'asheanji sin Ng'utamiidean mwahida,’ asi oaleaydiit ea fuga Israeli heapi? Ng'asheanda easinyi aniini mwahida? Dea oosinyi agooga mwahida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida doabiiwaat iinung'waada doobiiwnataanyi ak gwasin ng'asheega munyas ak ghami aba jeedeaba ng'asheesu munyasiin. Abeeda gayghami aba jeeda ng'asheagaaschi munyas sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida muy iinung'waada ng'asheagaaschi munyas sin ak gwasin gea hit doobiiweadi gayghoaghu gurooroadaanyi ak ghwanyas eaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gooteemshi ak ghwanung'waada giidiinyeanyeekaaschi sean ghayi sin aba huumwa gayghwanyas giibinda mayghami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea agooga fuga Israeli gooyeenyi, ‘ng'asheanji sin Ng'utamiidean mwahida,’ Ea fuga Israeli, ng'asheanda easinyi mwahida? Gidoosinyi agooga mwahida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi gaydeargweakseegwa agooga fuga Israeli, nea gaba nih bea naweadingaaschi gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. Abiikni ak ghoanung'waadi giidiinyeanyeekeagwa sean, abeeda munyindeang'wa ea mayghwadataseagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahisana hoowa sheagiin giidiinyeanyeekeagwa sean ghayi oosinyi ak ghoanyaschi jeeda miy ea guroorooda miy, ghwasaan anda googasayi ameawa Ea fuga Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aniini mii dahoosan aba miyeeda siida was sean, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, asi abiikni ak gajanyasa eaweega.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
